    "Content": "<p><b>What&nbsp;and&nbsp;Why:</b></p><p>Project&nbsp;Online&nbsp;Essentials&nbsp;has&nbsp;not&nbsp;been&nbsp;available&nbsp;for&nbsp;purchase&nbsp;since&nbsp;October&nbsp;1,&nbsp;2025.&nbsp;On&nbsp;October&nbsp;1,&nbsp;2026,&nbsp;Project&nbsp;Online&nbsp;Essentials&nbsp;will&nbsp;reach&nbsp;end&nbsp;of&nbsp;life.</p><p>Project&nbsp;Online&nbsp;Essentials&nbsp;currently&nbsp;provides&nbsp;licensing&nbsp;rights&nbsp;for&nbsp;Project&nbsp;Online&nbsp;and&nbsp;Project&nbsp;Server&nbsp;through&nbsp;Client&nbsp;Access&nbsp;Licenses&nbsp;(CALs).&nbsp;Organizations&nbsp;should&nbsp;transition&nbsp;affected&nbsp;users&nbsp;to&nbsp;supported&nbsp;replacement&nbsp;licenses&nbsp;before&nbsp;October&nbsp;1,&nbsp;2026,&nbsp;to&nbsp;ensure&nbsp;they&nbsp;retain&nbsp;the&nbsp;required&nbsp;access&nbsp;and&nbsp;licensing&nbsp;rights.</p><p>Project&nbsp;and&nbsp;Planner&nbsp;Plan&nbsp;1&nbsp;and&nbsp;Project&nbsp;and&nbsp;Planner&nbsp;Plan&nbsp;3&nbsp;provide&nbsp;broader&nbsp;capabilities&nbsp;than&nbsp;Project&nbsp;Online&nbsp;Essentials,&nbsp;including&nbsp;Planner&nbsp;Premium&nbsp;experiences,&nbsp;while&nbsp;continuing&nbsp;to&nbsp;provide&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;licensing&nbsp;rights&nbsp;for&nbsp;supported&nbsp;Project&nbsp;scenarios.</p><p></p><p><b>Impact&nbsp;on&nbsp;Your&nbsp;Organization:</b></p><p><strong>Who&nbsp;is&nbsp;affected:</strong>&nbsp;Organizations&nbsp;with&nbsp;users&nbsp;who&nbsp;are&nbsp;currently&nbsp;assigned&nbsp;Project&nbsp;Online&nbsp;Essentials&nbsp;licenses.</p><p><strong>Platforms&nbsp;and&nbsp;services:</strong></p><ul><li>Project&nbsp;Online</li><li>Project&nbsp;Server</li><li>Microsoft&nbsp;Planner</li></ul><p><strong>What&nbsp;will&nbsp;happen:</strong></p><ul><li>Project&nbsp;Online&nbsp;Essentials&nbsp;will&nbsp;reach&nbsp;end&nbsp;of&nbsp;life&nbsp;on&nbsp;October&nbsp;1,&nbsp;2026.</li><li>After&nbsp;October&nbsp;1,&nbsp;2026,&nbsp;users&nbsp;assigned&nbsp;Project&nbsp;Online&nbsp;Essentials&nbsp;will&nbsp;no&nbsp;longer&nbsp;have&nbsp;access&nbsp;through&nbsp;that&nbsp;license.</li><li>Users&nbsp;who&nbsp;require&nbsp;Planner&nbsp;Premium&nbsp;capabilities&nbsp;or&nbsp;applicable&nbsp;Project&nbsp;Server&nbsp;access&nbsp;rights&nbsp;must&nbsp;be&nbsp;assigned&nbsp;a&nbsp;supported&nbsp;replacement&nbsp;license.</li><li>Organizations&nbsp;using&nbsp;Project&nbsp;Server&nbsp;should&nbsp;review&nbsp;their&nbsp;licensing&nbsp;requirements&nbsp;and&nbsp;ensure&nbsp;affected&nbsp;users&nbsp;have&nbsp;the&nbsp;appropriate&nbsp;access&nbsp;rights&nbsp;after&nbsp;the&nbsp;retirement&nbsp;date.</li></ul><p></p><p><b>Action&nbsp;Required&nbsp;/&nbsp;Recommendations:</b></p><p>Complete&nbsp;the&nbsp;following&nbsp;actions&nbsp;before&nbsp;October&nbsp;1,&nbsp;2026:</p><ul><li>Review&nbsp;users&nbsp;who&nbsp;are&nbsp;currently&nbsp;assigned&nbsp;Project&nbsp;Online&nbsp;Essentials&nbsp;licenses.</li><li>Determine&nbsp;whether&nbsp;those&nbsp;users&nbsp;require&nbsp;Planner&nbsp;Premium&nbsp;capabilities,&nbsp;Project&nbsp;Server&nbsp;access&nbsp;rights,&nbsp;or&nbsp;both.</li><li>For&nbsp;users&nbsp;who&nbsp;require&nbsp;Planner&nbsp;Premium&nbsp;capabilities&nbsp;or&nbsp;Project&nbsp;Server&nbsp;CALs,&nbsp;assign&nbsp;Project&nbsp;and&nbsp;Planner&nbsp;Plan&nbsp;1&nbsp;or&nbsp;Project&nbsp;and&nbsp;Planner&nbsp;Plan&nbsp;3.</li><li>For&nbsp;users&nbsp;who&nbsp;require&nbsp;only&nbsp;Project&nbsp;Server&nbsp;Subscription&nbsp;Edition&nbsp;access&nbsp;rights,&nbsp;acquire&nbsp;the&nbsp;appropriate&nbsp;Project&nbsp;Server&nbsp;CALs.</li><li>Complete&nbsp;all&nbsp;licensing&nbsp;transitions&nbsp;before&nbsp;October&nbsp;1,&nbsp;2026,&nbsp;to&nbsp;avoid&nbsp;disruption&nbsp;to&nbsp;user&nbsp;access.</li></ul><p>We&nbsp;recommend&nbsp;notifying&nbsp;affected&nbsp;project&nbsp;managers,&nbsp;resource&nbsp;managers,&nbsp;and&nbsp;Project&nbsp;Server&nbsp;users&nbsp;about&nbsp;the&nbsp;retirement&nbsp;and&nbsp;any&nbsp;licensing&nbsp;changes&nbsp;that&nbsp;may&nbsp;affect&nbsp;their&nbsp;access&nbsp;or&nbsp;available&nbsp;capabilities.</p><p></p><p><b>Compliance&nbsp;Considerations:</b></p><p>No&nbsp;compliance&nbsp;considerations&nbsp;identified,&nbsp;review&nbsp;as&nbsp;appropriate&nbsp;for&nbsp;your&nbsp;organization.</p>",
